<h1>Procedural terrain detail</h1>
Elevation profiles on Earth: in the Alps the detail must add relief
below the resolution of the elevation data and stay continuous; the
open sea and the ground around Cape Canaveral must stay as flat as the
data. Needs Earth's elevation data (skipped without it).
END_HYPERDESC

